abstract: >-
  BridgePoint Intelligence is a U.S. property-intelligence platform and public research project focused on property matching, provenance, evidence quality, geospatial alignment, and explainable property-level prioritization. Public aggregate data intentionally excludes private property records, customer data, and proprietary scoring weights.
